{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1794231645,"nonce":"5cO/5/YeqxILg0gZ6s+Pryp1wLc=","message":"Landed on `roadmap-493a53c-integration` (36e9608..e703e4a).\n\n**Changes**\n- src/ui/popover.rs: new. Anchored overlay widget places the panel under its trigger (Start or End aligned, clamped to the window). The scrim closes on outside click. Panels for repo switcher, overflow menu, notifications and identity. Placement unit tests.\n- src/app.rs: `Popover` enum, `Notification`, `open_popover`, `notifications` (cap 100), `unread`, `identity`. New messages: TogglePopover, ClosePopover, ChooseRepo, SetTheme, ClearNotifications. `Identified` now carries the full identity. Notifications are fed by failed repo loads, write results, a Roadmap Done summary or failure, and config/save notices. Esc closes help, then popover, then sheet, then pane. 12 new tests.\n- src/gitbug/mod.rs: `current_user` replaced by `current_identity` returning an `Identity` with name and email.\n- src/ui/screen.rs: top bar rewired to the popovers. Chat icon removed. Bell unread badge. Avatar is now a button. The Roadmap Done overlay now renders on every section. `status_indicator` extracted for reuse.\n- src/ui/components.rs: `top_pill_maybe` (disabled pill).\n- src/theme/style.rs: `popover`, `badge` and `menu_item` styles. The `pill` style now dims when disabled.\n- src/keymap.rs: `Context.help_open` renamed `modal_open` and also set while the Done sheet is open. Escape label updated.\n\n**Gates:** tests ok · clippy ok · fmt ok\n**Review:** 1 findings — 1 auto, 0 by hand, 0 deferred\n\n**Decisions**\n- The \"New Bug\" pill was also a top-bar `Noop`. It is now disabled with a \"Not available yet\" tooltip, so no top-bar control sends `Message::Noop`. L7 wires it.\n- The popover is a real overlay widget plus a stack scrim. This gives exact anchoring for the left-side pills, whose widths vary with their text.\n- A Roadmap Done run reports one summary notification instead of one per close. The per-issue notifications for those closes are suppressed.\n- Locked repos are not notified, because the poll retries them every 5s.\n- The scan found that the Done sheet, now reachable from every section, let Issues keys fire behind it. Fixed by treating the sheet as modal in the keymap. Side effect: Cmd+digit, Cmd+B and Cmd+K are also ignored while the sheet is open.\n- The popover layout and click handling are covered by unit tests and a view-construction smoke test only. The GUI was not driven, so clicking through it has not been checked.","files":null}]}